# Anything env-shaped. Broader than plain `.env` on purpose: Windows "Save As"
# silently writes .env.txt, which the narrower rule left untracked-but-committable
# — and this repo has to be PUBLIC for free Actions minutes.
.env*
!.env.example

*.local

